# LazyEdge intentionally does not read ambient .env configuration.
#
# Pass the manifest and one role-specific bindings file explicitly:
#   lazyedge serve edge --config FILE --bindings FILE
#   lazyedge serve worker --config FILE --bindings FILE
#
# Bindings contain paths to owner-protected secret files; they do not contain
# raw capabilities. Never place tokens in URLs, CLI arguments, or this file.
